1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,000
An unnamed button is hard to identify
before you activate it.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:12,000
Replay A11y compares announcements
and lets you review the issue card text.

3
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,500
Before the fix, the button has no name.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:26,500
[TODO: Before TalkBack recording]

5
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:31,500
After the fix, the name tells you
it changes the delivery address.

6
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:40,500
[TODO: After TalkBack recording]

7
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:46,000
We'll use a synthetic Korean transcript.

8
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:53,000
Label the before and after excerpts
in one text file, then open it.

9
00:00:53,500 --> 00:01:00,000
Rules mask the phone number.
The app shows both excerpts.

10
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:07,000
Eligible English text can use
optional on-device redaction.

11
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:12,000
We request a suggestion
on a separate English sample.

12
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,500
The app verified an on-device response.

13
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:26,500
It suggests masking the fictional name
without changing either excerpt.

14
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:33,000
Korean redaction uses no model.
We remove the remaining name by hand.

15
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:40,000
The reviewed text can become
a card on this device.

16
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:45,000
No upload is needed for this card.

17
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:53,000
In the same workspace, the cloud option
takes only the before and after quotes.

18
00:01:53,500 --> 00:02:00,000
Review the full prompt with instructions.
The limit is 1,000 UTF-16 code units.

19
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Check for private details and approve.
Then click Send separately.

20
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:15,500
An isolated tab verifies the browser,
then sends the approved text.

21
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:22,500
Back in the workspace, we see
the cloud result in both languages.

22
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:29,500
Gemini writes the impact, retest steps,
and a possible fix in both languages.

23
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Both cards keep the approved quotes
exactly as written.

24
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:39,500
The log alone can't confirm the cause.

25
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:46,000
A person decides what to redact
and which excerpts, if any, to send.
